            "review_title": "Review at Dinh Y",
            "review_text": "Lilith Black\n18 contributions\n0\nWorst experience\nMay 2019 • Solo\nI have been in Saigon for a while and it's the first time I have such a horrible experience in a restaurant. First they claim that they are VEGAN (It says it on the cover of their menu) and then when they served me a smoothie with condensed milk they didn't want to accept their mistake or say sorry. I am lactose intolerant and this smoothie I drank started making me feel sick which is how I realized it was made with real cow milk. When I told them they looked angry and gave me another one without milk. I didn't feel like drinking anymore or eating anymore as I was feeling sick but still took it as I thought they were feeling bad and wanted to compensate. But when the bill came they still wanted me to pay for it and the lady took the money violently from my friends' hands and then didn't want to return the change and we said we want our change back and she screamed at me NO!!! and became aggressive. I have never been treated with such disrespect and will never go back there again. So everyone who thinks this place is vegan, IT'S NOT! Worst customer service in Asia so far.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 27, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
