            "review_text": "kerwinDean\nBaguio, Philippines10 contributions\n0\nVegan surprise\nJan 2019 • Family\nMy family and I went here during our week-long trip and I'm quite surprised to find out after the fact that this was a vegan restaurant. It was surprising because the food we ordered was savory and it tasted amazing. If I didn't know any better, I would've never thought that I'd be eating vegan food. If you're looking to switch up your diet or just looking for a place that serves vegan within Bui Vien district, this just might be the place for you\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 14, 2019",
