            "review_text": "JohnfromOakland\nOakland, California85 contributions\n0\nClean delicious cheap vegan Vietnamese\nMay 2018 • Friends\nIf you are looking for tablecloths, A/C and fluent English-speaking servers stay in LA. If you want fresh delicious cheap Vietnamese vegan foods in a clean fan-cooled restaraunt, this is a top relative choice. The fresh rolls were perfect. If you order the rice porridge after 3 PM it comes with an amazing and big goi (salad.) There are daily specials, I'm gonna go back.\nRead more\nWritten May 10, 2018",
