            "review_text": "Ruderies\nBrighton, United Kingdom178 contributions\n0\nYummy food\nMar 2017 • Couples\nThis is a really nice, local place serving great veggie food (it's not vegan though, despite what the menu says, as they do serve egg, although there are plenty of vegan options). The food was YUMMY - great baked rice with mock fish dish thing. The staff are rushed off their feet though and the service is SLOW. About 25 mins after ordering, the waiter who'd taken our order came over and asked us if we wanted to order something....Not a place to come to if you're in a hurry, but if you're happy to wait, it's certainly worth it. A lovely place and good value.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 12, 2017",
